The '''Anarch's Guild''' (not to be confused with the Anarchists of the [[Revolutionary League]]) are a [[sect]] whose philosophy, if you can call it that, is the creation and maintenance of stable pockets of reality in [[Limbo]] via a process called chaos-shaping.
